    "Project B": {
      "Clarity of Value Proposition": "• Clear – addresses the inefficiency of finding local sales and adds an engaging gamified element. The concept is immediately understandable.",
      "Market Size and Demand": "• Potentially large market – weekend treasure hunts are a common activity. The inclusion of municipal waste departments adds a unique angle and potential for broader impact.",
      "Feasibility and Development Plan": "• Development risks are clearly identified (dependencies, reward fulfillment). The team seems to have a solid understanding of the challenges.",
